[
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:03.350",
        "start_sec": 3.35,
        "end_time": "00:00:05.310",
        "end_sec": 5.31,
        "text": "[laughing] I don't know why I feel so old just trying to write a caption,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:05.360",
        "start_sec": 5.36,
        "end_time": "00:00:08.720",
        "end_sec": 8.72,
        "text": "\"Filming YouTube videos for business\", you know, like that's pretty lame."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:09.500",
        "start_sec": 9.5,
        "end_time": "00:00:15.320",
        "end_sec": 15.32,
        "text": "In August, my friend Jen sent me this DM, \"OMG Tiktok, it must be for teens, right?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:15.500",
        "start_sec": 15.5,
        "end_time": "00:00:20.090",
        "end_sec": 20.09,
        "text": "Please say we don't need one of those accounts now to, do we?\" And I said \"Haha,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:20.270",
        "start_sec": 20.27,
        "end_time": "00:00:23.930",
        "end_sec": 23.93,
        "text": "it's for teens, yes, but who knows? I'm sure marketers are on it already.\""
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:24.310",
        "start_sec": 24.31,
        "end_time": "00:00:28.270",
        "end_sec": 28.27,
        "text": "Well, this was only a month ago and here I am, a marketer,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:28.640",
        "start_sec": 28.64,
        "end_time": "00:00:29.680",
        "end_sec": 29.68,
        "text": "on it already."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:29.980",
        "start_sec": 29.98,
        "end_time": "00:00:34.810",
        "end_sec": 34.81,
        "text": "So in today's video I want to walk through Tiktok with you. And truly,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:34.811",
        "start_sec": 34.811,
        "end_time": "00:00:37.450",
        "end_sec": 37.45,
        "text": "I don't know if it's beneficial for business."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:37.480",
        "start_sec": 37.48,
        "end_time": "00:00:41.770",
        "end_sec": 41.77,
        "text": "So I'm going to go through the app for the very first time with you in today's"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:41.771",
        "start_sec": 41.771,
        "end_time": "00:00:49.170",
        "end_sec": 49.17,
        "text": "video and I hope by the end of it, you and me - entrepreneurs - will have a better idea of whether Tiktok is worth"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:49.271",
        "start_sec": 49.271,
        "end_time": "00:00:56.110",
        "end_sec": 56.11,
        "text": "our time or not. Maybe you've heard of Tiktok already, maybe your teenager's on it, or your niece or your nephew."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:56.350",
        "start_sec": 56.35,
        "end_time": "00:01:00.760",
        "end_sec": 60.76,
        "text": "But whenever these new fandangled apps come out that the teens are all over,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:00.970",
        "start_sec": 60.97,
        "end_time": "00:01:05.230",
        "end_sec": 65.23,
        "text": "us older folks or elder millennials as I like to call myself,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:07.680",
        "start_sec": 67.68,
        "end_time": "00:01:15.790",
        "end_sec": 75.78999999999999,
        "text": "oftentimes ignore it. We think right away \"the kids, the kids, that's for the kids. It's not for me. I'm a serious business person."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:16.060",
        "start_sec": 76.06,
        "end_time": "00:01:23.290",
        "end_sec": 83.28999999999999,
        "text": "That's just a waste of time.\" I have thought that myself, I mean Tiktok's actually been on the market for three years."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:23.320",
        "start_sec": 83.32,
        "end_time": "00:01:28.320",
        "end_sec": 88.32,
        "text": "It originally came out as Musical.ly and I think I downloaded it but never did"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:28.661",
        "start_sec": 88.661,
        "end_time": "00:01:32.110",
        "end_sec": 92.11,
        "text": "anything with it because I thought the same thing like eh, waste of time."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:32.111",
        "start_sec": 92.11099999999999,
        "end_time": "00:01:40.290",
        "end_sec": 100.28999999999999,
        "text": "Let's have, let's let the kids have their fun, you know, but here we are in 2019 and I am diving into Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:40.660",
        "start_sec": 100.66,
        "end_time": "00:01:44.920",
        "end_sec": 104.92,
        "text": "Let's cover exactly what Tiktok is and then let's explore the app together."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:45.130",
        "start_sec": 105.13,
        "end_time": "00:01:53.840",
        "end_sec": 113.84,
        "text": "So what's Tiktok? Well, imagine if Snapchat, Spotify, Vine and Twitch, had a baby. Their baby would be Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:54.430",
        "start_sec": 114.43,
        "end_time": "00:01:57.550",
        "end_sec": 117.55,
        "text": "Now if it sounded like I just said Spanglish to you and you're like,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:57.551",
        "start_sec": 117.551,
        "end_time": "00:01:58.570",
        "end_sec": 118.57,
        "text": "what are all those things?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:58.900",
        "start_sec": 118.9,
        "end_time": "00:02:03.190",
        "end_sec": 123.19,
        "text": "Basically what Tiktok is is an app for iOS and Android."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:03.250",
        "start_sec": 123.25,
        "end_time": "00:02:07.750",
        "end_sec": 127.75,
        "text": "It's a way for you to share lip sync, comedy and talent videos."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:08.050",
        "start_sec": 128.05,
        "end_time": "00:02:11.920",
        "end_sec": 131.92,
        "text": "Don't run away just yet because from what I've seen of Tiktok already,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:11.921",
        "start_sec": 131.921,
        "end_time": "00:02:16.660",
        "end_sec": 136.66,
        "text": "you don't necessarily need to be Jennifer Lopez to be posting these videos and"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:16.661",
        "start_sec": 136.661,
        "end_time": "00:02:18.280",
        "end_sec": 138.28,
        "text": "entertaining the masses."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:18.310",
        "start_sec": 138.31,
        "end_time": "00:02:23.310",
        "end_sec": 143.31,
        "text": "So the other thing to take note here is in 2019 Tiktok is the fastest growing"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:25.120",
        "start_sec": 145.12,
        "end_time": "00:02:30.040",
        "end_sec": 150.04,
        "text": "app. We're talking already 500 million active users."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:30.370",
        "start_sec": 150.37,
        "end_time": "00:02:34.690",
        "end_sec": 154.69,
        "text": "To put that into context, Instagram has over a billion. So at this stage,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:34.770",
        "start_sec": 154.77,
        "end_time": "00:02:38.560",
        "end_sec": 158.56,
        "text": "Tiktok already has half the amount of users that Instagram has."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:38.561",
        "start_sec": 158.561,
        "end_time": "00:02:42.430",
        "end_sec": 162.43,
        "text": "So that's a lot of people who are spending time in that app."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:42.520",
        "start_sec": 162.52,
        "end_time": "00:02:50.350",
        "end_sec": 170.35,
        "text": "So why should we, serious business people, care about Tiktok? Well, based on my initial research, here's what I've found."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:50.650",
        "start_sec": 170.65,
        "end_time": "00:02:54.310",
        "end_sec": 174.31,
        "text": "The app is basically the wild, wild west of social media."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:54.311",
        "start_sec": 174.311,
        "end_time": "00:03:02.680",
        "end_sec": 182.68,
        "text": "So think back to Instagram back in 2011, 2012, when we all wished went all in on Instagram. That's today. That's right."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:02.681",
        "start_sec": 182.681,
        "end_time": "00:03:09.100",
        "end_sec": 189.1,
        "text": "Now when it comes to Tiktok, the other cool thing about it is you can really be known for your niche really"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:09.101",
        "start_sec": 189.101,
        "end_time": "00:03:13.600",
        "end_sec": 193.6,
        "text": "quickly. There's already a ton of niches on the app in the makeup world,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:13.630",
        "start_sec": 193.63,
        "end_time": "00:03:19.210",
        "end_sec": 199.21,
        "text": "travel, art, fitness, so now would be the time to get established in your niche."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:19.300",
        "start_sec": 199.3,
        "end_time": "00:03:23.350",
        "end_sec": 203.35,
        "text": "The trick will be to figure out how your niche works on Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:23.650",
        "start_sec": 203.65,
        "end_time": "00:03:28.510",
        "end_sec": 208.51,
        "text": "You can only upload 15 second recordings or you can stitch together multiple"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:28.511",
        "start_sec": 208.511,
        "end_time": "00:03:33.670",
        "end_sec": 213.67000000000002,
        "text": "recordings for 60 seconds, but this isn't the app to bore people with your trainings."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:33.671",
        "start_sec": 213.671,
        "end_time": "00:03:37.540",
        "end_sec": 217.54,
        "text": "You're going to want to blend entertainment with your information."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:37.660",
        "start_sec": 217.66,
        "end_time": "00:03:41.980",
        "end_sec": 221.98,
        "text": "One of the coolest things about Tiktok is the potential for a large audience"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:42.040",
        "start_sec": 222.04,
        "end_time": "00:03:49.630",
        "end_sec": 229.63,
        "text": "transfer. What does that mean? Basically, you can grow an audience on Tiktok really fast and then connect them over to"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:49.631",
        "start_sec": 229.631,
        "end_time": "00:03:54.400",
        "end_sec": 234.4,
        "text": "your other social media platforms like Instagram or YouTube. Back in the day,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:54.401",
        "start_sec": 234.401,
        "end_time": "00:04:00.980",
        "end_sec": 240.98,
        "text": "other social media networks used to be really good for that, but now they're all pretty popular and pretty saturated but not Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:01.060",
        "start_sec": 241.06,
        "end_time": "00:04:07.720",
        "end_sec": 247.72,
        "text": "Let's talk business potential of Tiktok. As I just mentioned, there's this share-ability factor within the app,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:07.960",
        "start_sec": 247.96,
        "end_time": "00:04:12.790",
        "end_sec": 252.79,
        "text": "so connecting to your other social networks or creating a video in the app and"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:12.791",
        "start_sec": 252.791,
        "end_time": "00:04:16.060",
        "end_sec": 256.06,
        "text": "then being able to save it to your phone, save it as a GIF,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:16.090",
        "start_sec": 256.09,
        "end_time": "00:04:17.830",
        "end_sec": 257.83,
        "text": "share it to your Instagram stories."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:18.040",
        "start_sec": 258.04,
        "end_time": "00:04:21.790",
        "end_sec": 261.79,
        "text": "You can easily mix and match platforms starting with Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:21.820",
        "start_sec": 261.82,
        "end_time": "00:04:28.270",
        "end_sec": 268.27,
        "text": "It's also a low pressure environment, so if you feel like sharing on your Instagram stories or in your feed is giving"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:28.271",
        "start_sec": 268.271,
        "end_time": "00:04:32.710",
        "end_sec": 272.71,
        "text": "you anxiety, like, \"I have to be perfect\", Tiktok is the place to practice."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:32.711",
        "start_sec": 272.711,
        "end_time": "00:04:37.690",
        "end_sec": 277.69,
        "text": "Just think in terms of, well, no one's really following me here and no one's really watching and caring,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:37.900",
        "start_sec": 277.9,
        "end_time": "00:04:42.550",
        "end_sec": 282.55,
        "text": "so that's one way to get used to being visible and showing up more in your"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:42.551",
        "start_sec": 282.551,
        "end_time": "00:04:43.384",
        "end_sec": 283.384,
        "text": "business."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:43.600",
        "start_sec": 283.6,
        "end_time": "00:04:48.160",
        "end_sec": 288.15999999999997,
        "text": "The other cool thing I'm seeing about Tiktok is it's really not a perfect and"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:48.161",
        "start_sec": 288.161,
        "end_time": "00:04:51.730",
        "end_sec": 291.73,
        "text": "pretty competition as we sometimes see on Instagram."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:51.940",
        "start_sec": 291.94,
        "end_time": "00:04:56.230",
        "end_sec": 296.23,
        "text": "Tiktok is not about showing \"your best self\" and \"your best life\"."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:56.410",
        "start_sec": 296.40999999999997,
        "end_time": "00:05:00.250",
        "end_sec": 300.25,
        "text": "It's all about being real and showing the world who you are."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:00.251",
        "start_sec": 300.251,
        "end_time": "00:05:04.390",
        "end_sec": 304.39,
        "text": "Maybe that means you're not the fittest person in the world or not the most"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:04.391",
        "start_sec": 304.391,
        "end_time": "00:05:08.230",
        "end_sec": 308.23,
        "text": "productive person in the world, but you can still show up, dance a little,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:08.290",
        "start_sec": 308.29,
        "end_time": "00:05:10.690",
        "end_sec": 310.69,
        "text": "have a good time, and entertain your followers."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:10.810",
        "start_sec": 310.81,
        "end_time": "00:05:15.370",
        "end_sec": 315.37,
        "text": "Plus we've got some new features that have just hit Tiktok including the ability"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:15.371",
        "start_sec": 315.371,
        "end_time": "00:05:18.250",
        "end_sec": 318.25,
        "text": "to run ads. Yay. I love paid advertising."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:18.670",
        "start_sec": 318.67,
        "end_time": "00:05:24.820",
        "end_sec": 324.82,
        "text": "And the ability to go live. So yes, we already have these features with Facebook and Instagram,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:24.850",
        "start_sec": 324.85,
        "end_time": "00:05:29.710",
        "end_sec": 329.71,
        "text": "but obviously Tiktok is growing so fast because they've already brought them"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:29.711",
        "start_sec": 329.711,
        "end_time": "00:05:34.420",
        "end_sec": 334.42,
        "text": "over to their platform too. So I have Tiktok downloaded on my phone already."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:34.421",
        "start_sec": 334.421,
        "end_time": "00:05:37.690",
        "end_sec": 337.69,
        "text": "It's in the depths of my social media apps, but I found it."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:37.720",
        "start_sec": 337.72,
        "end_time": "00:05:41.080",
        "end_sec": 341.08,
        "text": "So let's go into the Tiktok app together right now."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:41.940",
        "start_sec": 341.94,
        "end_time": "00:05:43.990",
        "end_sec": 343.99,
        "text": "Nope. No."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:47.810",
        "start_sec": 347.81,
        "end_time": "00:05:51.110",
        "end_sec": 351.11,
        "text": "Okay. Definitely young. Definitely young demographic right away."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:51.340",
        "start_sec": 351.34000000000003,
        "end_time": "00:05:54.710",
        "end_sec": 354.71,
        "text": "Looks like I'm signed in already. Oh my God. What did I hit?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:58.670",
        "start_sec": 358.67,
        "end_time": "00:06:04.294",
        "end_sec": 364.294,
        "text": "Okay, um... 1.7 million hearts, that video."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:05.280",
        "start_sec": 365.28,
        "end_time": "00:06:06.660",
        "end_sec": 366.66,
        "text": "Let's go to the Discover tab."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:08.100",
        "start_sec": 368.1,
        "end_time": "00:06:12.630",
        "end_sec": 372.63,
        "text": "\"Dorm life\" is a trending hashtag. \"Joke is on you\" is a trending hashtag."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:13.650",
        "start_sec": 373.65,
        "end_time": "00:06:18.930",
        "end_sec": 378.93,
        "text": "I actually like that they have hashtags. I mean, this is already one great way to get your niche going."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:19.410",
        "start_sec": 379.41,
        "end_time": "00:06:23.310",
        "end_sec": 383.31,
        "text": "Let's look at me for a second. Oh, I need a Tiktok account to continue."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:24.210",
        "start_sec": 384.21,
        "end_time": "00:06:26.610",
        "end_sec": 386.61,
        "text": "Here we go. All right, so here's where I actually sign up."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:26.980",
        "start_sec": 386.98,
        "end_time": "00:06:27.813",
        "end_sec": 387.813,
        "text": "[French accent] Two very boring minutes later..."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:29.280",
        "start_sec": 389.28,
        "end_time": "00:06:33.000",
        "end_sec": 393.0,
        "text": "All right, so my beautiful user account is here. User 3831693513447."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:36.240",
        "start_sec": 396.24,
        "end_time": "00:06:38.610",
        "end_sec": 398.61,
        "text": "Amazing, zero followers."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:38.910",
        "start_sec": 398.90999999999997,
        "end_time": "00:06:43.140",
        "end_sec": 403.14,
        "text": "But the app is prompting me to create your first short video."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:43.530",
        "start_sec": 403.53,
        "end_time": "00:06:44.370",
        "end_sec": 404.37,
        "text": "Let's do that."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:46.330",
        "start_sec": 406.33,
        "end_time": "00:06:50.850",
        "end_sec": 410.85,
        "text": "Allow access to everything. You can have me Tiktok."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:51.790",
        "start_sec": 411.79,
        "end_time": "00:06:55.000",
        "end_sec": 415.0,
        "text": "Okay, so there's Effie."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:56.500",
        "start_sec": 416.5,
        "end_time": "00:07:00.550",
        "end_sec": 420.55,
        "text": "I will flip to film this way."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:11.040",
        "start_sec": 431.04,
        "end_time": "00:07:14.970",
        "end_sec": 434.97,
        "text": "Okay, let's be cool and not talk in these videos. And then,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:14.971",
        "start_sec": 434.971,
        "end_time": "00:07:19.710",
        "end_sec": 439.71,
        "text": "then let's add some sounds. Electronic."
    },
    {
